<p>Hello {{ hostName }},</p>

<p>Thank you for submitting "{{ sessionTitle }}" to {{ editionName }}.</p>

<p>Unfortunately we were not able to include your session this time. We hope to see another submission from you in the future.</p>
{%- if note != "" %}

<p>A note from the organizers:</p>

<p>{{ note | escape | newline_to_br | raw }}</p>
{%- endif %}

<p><a href="{{ sessionUrl }}">View your session</a></p>
